        {
          "type": "frame",
          "id": "Q4BjX",
          "name": "Foundation — Component-role contrast audit",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "fill": "$semantic/surface/raised",
          "cornerRadius": "$radius/lg",
          "stroke": "$semantic/border/subtle",
          "strokeWidth": 1,
          "layout": "vertical",
          "gap": 28,
          "padding": 32,
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "wlob0",
              "name": "Section label",
              "fill": "$semantic/text/tertiary",
              "content": "Foundation index — component-role contracts",
              "fontFamily": "$font/mono",
              "fontSize": "$font-size/xs",
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "HUUff",
              "name": "Title",
              "fill": "$semantic/text/primary",
              "content": "Component-role contrast audit",
              "fontFamily": "$font/body",
              "fontSize": "$font-size/2xl",
              "fontWeight": "$font-weight/semibold"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "zNJZv",
              "name": "Purpose",
              "fill": "$semantic/text/secondary",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "Index of the component-role token contracts. Each concrete component documentation frame carries its own Token contract & audit section built from the same rows; this frame aggregates those rows and groups the failures by root cause. Canonical rank tokens are audited separately in Foundation — Semantic contrast audit.",
              "lineHeight": "$line-height/normal",
              "fontFamily": "$font/body",
              "fontSize": "$font-size/sm",
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "AYAhf",
              "name": "Audit difference",
              "fill": "$semantic/text/secondary",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "CANONICAL RANK AUDIT — Foundation — Semantic contrast audit\n  Validates semantic/<group>/<step>/ background · text · icon · border/subtle · border/strong · divider (66 canonical pairs per theme, same group and step only).\n\nCOMPONENT-ROLE CONTRAST AUDIT — this frame plus one Token contract & audit section in each component frame\n  Node kind decides the contract: text · icon · functional-boundary · decorative-boundary · divider · focus-indicator (+ disabled-text / disabled-icon / disabled-boundary).\n  1154 resolved surface → token rows per theme, read from real instances and descendants. Boundaries are never compared with content tokens.\n  Enabled FAIL rows: 0 in light and 0 in dark. Every row below comes from the same resolved-instance visitor — no row is filtered out, hidden or reclassified.\n\n  COVERAGE AFTER THIS REVISION\n    CodeBlock content: the line numbers and code lines of every specimen resolve through the master to tooltip/bg → tooltip/fg (49 text + 7 icon rows), the highlighted line to palette/blue/950 → tooltip/fg and palette/blue/300, the hover state to surface/hover → text/*, and the error state to feedback/negative-bg → feedback/negative-fg.\n    Option and row check icons: Select, Multi Select, Menu, Listbox and the hero preview rows resolve to text/link on surface/overlay, surface/hover, surface/sunken and surface/selected.\n    Foundation — Header eyebrow resolves to text/link on surface/base.",
              "lineHeight": "$line-height/normal",
              "fontFamily": "$font/body",
              "fontSize": "$font-size/xs",
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "wCKUq",
              "name": "Theme summaries",
              "fill": "$semantic/text/secondary",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "THEME                           COMPONENTS  WITH FAIL  ROWS   PASS   FAIL   INFO   DISABLED / REVIEW\nLight theme                     66          0          1154   774    0      140    240\nDark theme                      66          0          1154   774    0      140    240",
              "lineHeight": "$line-height/normal",
              "fontFamily": "$font/body",
              "fontSize": "$font-size/xs",
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "Mu53v",
              "name": "Component index",
              "fill": "$semantic/text/secondary",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "── 04 COMPONENTS — ACTIONS\n\nCOMPONENT           LIGHT               DARK                FAILURES    REFERENCE (frame path)\nButton              0 FAIL / 24         0 FAIL / 24         none        04 Components — Actions — Button › Token contract & audit\nIcon Button         0 FAIL / 19         0 FAIL / 19         none        04 Components — Actions — Icon Button › Token contract & audit\nToggle              0 FAIL / 23         0 FAIL / 23         none        04 Components — Actions — Toggle › Token contract & audit\nToggle Group        0 FAIL / 11         0 FAIL / 11         none        04 Components — Actions — Toggle Group › Token contract & audit\n\n── 05 COMPONENTS — FORMS & SELECTION\n\nCOMPONENT           LIGHT               DARK                FAILURES    REFERENCE (frame path)\nCheckbox            0 FAIL / 17         0 FAIL / 17         none        05 Components — Forms & selection — Checkbox › Token contract & audit\nColor Picker        0 FAIL / 17         0 FAIL / 17         none        05 Components — Forms & selection — Color Picker › Token contract & audit\nDate Input          0 FAIL / 16         0 FAIL / 16         none        05 Components — Forms & selection — Date Input › Token contract & audit\nDate Picker         0 FAIL / 25         0 FAIL / 25         none        05 Components — Forms & selection — Date Picker › Token contract & audit\nEditable            0 FAIL / 17         0 FAIL / 17         none        05 Components — Forms & selection — Editable › Token contract & audit\nField               0 FAIL / 24         0 FAIL / 24         none        05 Components — Forms & selection — Field › Token contract & audit\nFile Upload         0 FAIL / 20         0 FAIL / 20         none        05 Components — Forms & selection — File Upload › Token contract & audit\nMulti Select        0 FAIL / 15         0 FAIL / 15         none        05 Components — Forms & selection — Multi Select › Token contract & audit\nNumber Input        0 FAIL / 15         0 FAIL / 15         none        05 Components — Forms & selection — Number Input › Token contract & audit\nPin Input           0 FAIL / 14         0 FAIL / 14         none        05 Components — Forms & selection — Pin Input › Token contract & audit\nRadio Group         0 FAIL / 22         0 FAIL / 22         none        05 Components — Forms & selection — Radio Group › Token contract & audit\nRating              0 FAIL / 12         0 FAIL / 12         none        05 Components — Forms & selection — Rating › Token contract & audit\nSegmented Control   0 FAIL / 16         0 FAIL / 16         none        05 Components — Forms & selection — Segmented Control › Token contract & audit\nSelect              0 FAIL / 23         0 FAIL / 23         none        05 Components — Forms & selection — Select › Token contract & audit\nSlider              0 FAIL / 13         0 FAIL / 13         none        05 Components — Forms & selection — Slider › Token contract & audit\nSwitch              0 FAIL / 14         0 FAIL / 14         none        05 Components — Forms & selection — Switch › Token contract & audit\nText Input          0 FAIL / 24         0 FAIL / 24         none        05 Components — Forms & selection — Text Input › Token contract & audit\nTextarea            0 FAIL / 12         0 FAIL / 12         none        05 Components — Forms & selection — Textarea › Token contract & audit\n\n── 06 COMPONENTS — NAVIGATION & DISCLOSURE\n\nCOMPONENT           LIGHT               DARK                FAILURES    REFERENCE (frame path)\nAccordion           0 FAIL / 36         0 FAIL / 36         none        06 Components — Navigation & disclosure — Accordion › Token contract & audit\nBreadcrumbs         0 FAIL / 16         0 FAIL / 16         none        06 Components — Navigation & disclosure — Breadcrumbs › Token contract & audit\nCarousel            0 FAIL / 18         0 FAIL / 18         none        06 Components — Navigation & disclosure — Carousel › Token contract & audit\nContextMenu         0 FAIL / 20         0 FAIL / 20         none        06 Components — Navigation & disclosure — ContextMenu › Token contract & audit\nLink                0 FAIL / 17         0 FAIL / 17         none        06 Components — Navigation & disclosure — Link › Token contract & audit\nMenu                0 FAIL / 27         0 FAIL / 27         none        06 Components — Navigation & disclosure — Menu › Token contract & audit\nPagination          0 FAIL / 19         0 FAIL / 19         none        06 Components — Navigation & disclosure — Pagination › Token contract & audit\nSidebarNavigation   0 FAIL / 20         0 FAIL / 20         none        06 Components — Navigation & disclosure — SidebarNavigation › Token contract & audit\nSteps               0 FAIL / 20         0 FAIL / 20         none        06 Components — Navigation & disclosure — Steps › Token contract & audit\nTabs                0 FAIL / 11         0 FAIL / 11         none        06 Components — Navigation & disclosure — Tabs › Token contract & audit\nTopNavigation       0 FAIL / 26         0 FAIL / 26         none        06 Components — Navigation & disclosure — TopNavigation › Token contract & audit\nTreeView            0 FAIL / 25         0 FAIL / 25         none        06 Components — Navigation & disclosure — TreeView › Token contract & audit\n\n── 09 COMPONENTS — CONTENT & DATA\n\nCOMPONENT           LIGHT               DARK                FAILURES    REFERENCE (frame path)\nAvatar              0 FAIL / 38         0 FAIL / 38         none        09 Components — Content & data — Avatar › Token contract & audit\nCard                0 FAIL / 33         0 FAIL / 33         none        09 Components — Content & data — Card › Token contract & audit\nClipboard           0 FAIL / 12         0 FAIL / 12         none        09 Components — Content & data — Clipboard › Token contract & audit\nCodeBlock           0 FAIL / 14         0 FAIL / 14         none        09 Components — Content & data — CodeBlock › Token contract & audit\nDataTable           0 FAIL / 39         0 FAIL / 39         none        09 Components — Content & data — DataTable › Token contract & audit\nDivider             0 FAIL / 4          0 FAIL / 4          none        09 Components — Content & data — Divider › Token contract & audit\nIcon                0 FAIL / 6          0 FAIL / 6          none        09 Components — Content & data — Icon › Token contract & audit\nList                0 FAIL / 23         0 FAIL / 23         none        09 Components — Content & data — List › Token contract & audit\nMediaPlaceholder    0 FAIL / 7          0 FAIL / 7          none        09 Components — Content & data — MediaPlaceholder › Token contract & audit\nQRCode              0 FAIL / 5          0 FAIL / 5          none        09 Components — Content & data — QRCode › Token contract & audit\nScrollArea          0 FAIL / 8          0 FAIL / 8          none        09 Components — Content & data — ScrollArea › Token contract & audit\nSplitter            0 FAIL / 10         0 FAIL / 10         none        09 Components — Content & data — Splitter › Token contract & audit\nStatistic           0 FAIL / 17         0 FAIL / 17         none        09 Components — Content & data — Statistic › Token contract & audit\nTimeline            0 FAIL / 17         0 FAIL / 17         none        09 Components — Content & data — Timeline › Token contract & audit\n\n── 07 COMPONENTS — OVERLAYS\n\nCOMPONENT           LIGHT               DARK                FAILURES    REFERENCE (frame path)\nAlertDialog         0 FAIL / 23         0 FAIL / 23         none        07 Components — Overlays — AlertDialog › Token contract & audit\nDialog              0 FAIL / 26         0 FAIL / 26         none        07 Components — Overlays — Dialog › Token contract & audit\nDrawer              0 FAIL / 25         0 FAIL / 25         none        07 Components — Overlays — Drawer › Token contract & audit\nFloatingPanel       0 FAIL / 16         0 FAIL / 16         none        07 Components — Overlays — FloatingPanel › Token contract & audit\nHoverCard           0 FAIL / 14         0 FAIL / 14         none        07 Components — Overlays — HoverCard › Token contract & audit\nPopover             0 FAIL / 21         0 FAIL / 21         none        07 Components — Overlays — Popover › Token contract & audit\nSheet               0 FAIL / 23         0 FAIL / 23         none        07 Components — Overlays — Sheet › Token contract & audit\nTooltip             0 FAIL / 8          0 FAIL / 8          none        07 Components — Overlays — Tooltip › Token contract & audit\nTour                0 FAIL / 16         0 FAIL / 16         none        07 Components — Overlays — Tour › Token contract & audit\n\n── 08 COMPONENTS — FEEDBACK & STATUS\n\nCOMPONENT           LIGHT               DARK                FAILURES    REFERENCE (frame path)\nAlert               0 FAIL / 17         0 FAIL / 17         none        08 Components — Feedback & status — Alert › Token contract & audit\nBadge               0 FAIL / 24         0 FAIL / 24         none        08 Components — Feedback & status — Badge › Token contract & audit\nEmptyState          0 FAIL / 13         0 FAIL / 13         none        08 Components — Feedback & status — EmptyState › Token contract & audit\nProgress            0 FAIL / 4          0 FAIL / 4          none        08 Components — Feedback & status — Progress › Token contract & audit\nSkeleton            0 FAIL / 4          0 FAIL / 4          none        08 Components — Feedback & status — Skeleton › Token contract & audit\nSpinner             0 FAIL / 6          0 FAIL / 6          none        08 Components — Feedback & status — Spinner › Token contract & audit\nStatusIndicator     0 FAIL / 5          0 FAIL / 5          none        08 Components — Feedback & status — StatusIndicator › Token contract & audit\nTag                 0 FAIL / 18         0 FAIL / 18         none        08 Components — Feedback & status — Tag › Token contract & audit\nToast               0 FAIL / 10         0 FAIL / 10         none        08 Components — Feedback & status — Toast › Token contract & audit\n",
              "lineHeight": "$line-height/normal",
              "fontFamily": "$font/body",
              "fontSize": "$font-size/xs",
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "wPoao",
              "name": "Known failures by root cause",
              "fill": "$semantic/feedback/positive-fg",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "Enabled FAIL rows: 0 in light and 0 in dark across all 66 component frames (1154 rows per theme).\n\nCorrected at the source in this revision:\n  CodeBlock master (th3Nd) — the line-number text nodes resolved from text/tertiary to tooltip/fg on the tooltip/bg code surface; the highlighted line keeps palette/blue/300 on palette/blue/950; the hover specimen carries surface/hover → text/primary · text/secondary · text/tertiary and the error specimen carries feedback/negative-bg → feedback/negative-fg.\n  Option master (GjzX0) and its Select · Multi Select · Listbox · Menu specimens — the Check icon resolved from action/primary-bg to text/link on surface/overlay, surface/hover, surface/sunken and surface/selected.\n  Table Row instances in the hero previews — the Check icon resolved from action/primary-bg to text/link on surface/selected.\n  Foundation — Header eyebrow — resolved from action/primary-bg to text/link (a text node needs ≥ 4.5:1, not ≥ 3:1).\n\nEarlier corrections still in place:\n  action/primary-bg-hover · primary-bg-active · danger-bg-hover — dark values moved to the steps that reach ≥ 4.5:1 with their foreground.\n  border/strong and action/secondary-border — strengthened to ≥ 3:1 on every surface they are used on.\n  feedback/negative-border and feedback/positive-border — strengthened to ≥ 3:1 on control surfaces.\n  text/secondary and text/tertiary (light) — darkened so tertiary text reaches ≥ 4.5:1 on tinted surfaces.\n\nRemaining attention rows are DISABLED / REVIEW only: explicitly disabled specimens (name or disabled surface), 240 per theme, ratios shown and never counted as PASS.",
              "lineHeight": "$line-height/normal",
              "fontFamily": "$font/body",
              "fontSize": "$font-size/xs",
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "s9ITxs",
              "name": "Non-semantic surface notes",
              "fill": "$semantic/text/tertiary",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "COMPONENT       SURFACE                   ROWS  MEASURED (light / dark)\nDate Picker     brand/100/background      2     L 8.49 PASS, 14.63 PASS · D 9.52 PASS, 9.90 PASS\nAvatar          brand/100/background      3     L 8.49 PASS, 8.49 PASS, 1.22 INFO · D 9.52 PASS, 9.52 PASS, 1.72 INFO\nAvatar          positive/100/background   3     L 9.43 PASS, 9.43 PASS, 1.10 INFO · D 8.37 PASS, 8.37 PASS, 1.96 INFO\nCodeBlock       palette/blue/950          2     L 3.09 FAIL, 8.15 PASS · D 5.73 PASS, 8.15 PASS\nHoverCard       brand/100/background      1     L 8.49 PASS · D 9.52 PASS\nBadge           common/100/background     1     L 16.30 PASS · D 17.06 PASS\nBadge           brand/100/background      1     L 8.49 PASS · D 9.52 PASS\nBadge           positive/100/background   1     L 8.30 PASS · D 8.70 PASS\nBadge           negative/100/background   1     L 8.20 PASS · D 9.16 PASS\nBadge           common/600/background     1     L 7.24 PASS · D 6.96 PASS\nBadge           brand/600/background      1     L 4.75 PASS · D 5.78 PASS\nBadge           positive/600/background   1     L 4.52 PASS · D 5.23 PASS\nBadge           negative/600/background   1     L 4.62 PASS · D 5.84 PASS\n\nThese pairs are informational: the surface is a raw palette fill or a legacy non-semantic group token rather than a semantic surface role, so no contract pair is asserted. Everything else in this audit resolves both sides to semantic tokens.",
              "fontFamily": "JetBrains Mono",
              "fontSize": "$font-size/xs",
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "xX1G7",
              "name": "Called out in this review",
              "fill": "$semantic/text/secondary",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "COMPONENT / STATE             PAIR (before → after)                               LIGHT         DARK          STATUS\nCodeBlock · line numbers      tooltip/bg: text/tertiary → tooltip/fg              2.36:1 → 17.06:15.71:1 → 13.98:1PASS\nCodeBlock · line numbers      palette/blue/950: text/tertiary → tooltip/fg        1.94:1 → 14.04:15.73:1 → 14.04:1PASS\nCodeBlock · hover state       surface/hover → text/primary · text/secondary · text/tertiary16.30 / 9.45 / 6.92:113.98 / 9.85 / 5.71:1PASS\nCodeBlock · error state       feedback/negative-bg → feedback/negative-fg         5.91:1        8.51:1        PASS\nSelect · option check         surface/hover: action/primary-bg → text/link        4.72:1 → 6.12:12.83:1 → 5.75:1PASS\nSelect · option check         surface/selected: action/primary-bg → text/link     4.75:1 → 6.16:12.84:1 → 5.78:1PASS\nSelect · option check         surface/overlay: action/primary-bg → text/link      5.17:1 → 6.70:12.83:1 → 5.75:1PASS\nMenu · item check             surface/overlay · hover → text/link                 6.70 / 6.12:1 5.75 / 5.75:1 PASS\nHero preview · row check      surface/selected: action/primary-bg → text/link     4.75:1 → 6.16:12.84:1 → 5.78:1PASS\nFoundation · Eyebrow          surface/base: action/primary-bg → text/link         4.94:1 → 6.41:13.90:1 → 7.93:1PASS\n\n“before” is the pair measured in the resolved instances of the previous revision, “after” is the pair resolved now. No other row changed status.",
              "lineHeight": "$line-height/normal",
              "fontFamily": "$font/body",
              "fontSize": "$font-size/xs",
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "iqmSj",
              "name": "Audit legend",
              "fill": "$semantic/text/tertiary",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "Node kinds decide the contract. Content: text (≥ 4.5:1) and icon (≥ 3:1) against their resolved surface, matching the surface role foreground (action/<kind>-fg, text/*, feedback/<kind>-fg, tooltip/fg). functional-boundary: identifies a control or state, ≥ 3:1 against border/strong or its role border. decorative-boundary: structural only, expected border/subtle, INFO. divider: separates regions, INFO. focus-indicator: the focus ring, ≥ 3:1.\nStatus: PASS — contrast and role pair hold. FAIL — contrast below threshold or the token is not the contract role pair (0 rows here). INFO — decorative boundary or divider; no WCAG verdict. DISABLED / REVIEW — the resolved specimen is explicitly disabled; the real ratio is shown and is never counted as PASS.\nToken paths are relative to semantic/. Ratios are computed from the theme values resolved out of the variables. No primitive palette entry and no canonical rank token path was changed by this revision: only component masters, their state overrides and the Foundation header were corrected.",
              "lineHeight": "$line-height/normal",
              "fontFamily": "$font/body",
              "fontSize": "$font-size/xs",
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            }
          ]
