            {
              "type": "frame",
              "id": "hPzbs",
              "name": "Token contract & audit",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "stroke": "$semantic/border/subtle",
              "strokeWidth": {
                "top": 1
              },
              "layout": "vertical",
              "gap": 14,
              "padding": [
                22,
                0,
                0,
                0
              ],
              "children": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "ZGQyQ",
                  "name": "Section label",
                  "fill": "$semantic/text/tertiary",
                  "content": "Token contract & audit",
                  "fontFamily": "$font/mono",
                  "fontSize": "$font-size/xs",
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "n0Iu99",
                  "name": "Scope",
                  "fill": "$semantic/text/secondary",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "Audit of the resolved role tokens used by this component's specimens. Every node is classified first by kind — text, icon, functional-boundary, decorative-boundary, divider, focus-indicator or the disabled-* variants — and only then compared with the expected contract pair, in light and dark. This is not the canonical rank audit: Foundation validates semantic/<group>/<step> tokens, this section validates component-role pairs (action, surface, text, border, focus, feedback, tooltip, overlay). Disabled visuals are marked DISABLED and never treated as PASS.",
                  "lineHeight": "$line-height/normal",
                  "fontFamily": "$font/body",
                  "fontSize": "$font-size/sm",
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "Lfdw7",
                  "name": "Contract table",
                  "fill": "$semantic/text/secondary",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "STATE / VARIANT           KIND                SURFACE                   TEXT (expected)       ICON (expected)       BOUNDARY (expected)       FOCUS       EXPECTED RULE\nTone row                  decorative-boundary surface/raised            —                     —                     border/subtle             —           INFO\nTone row                  text + icon         surface/raised            text/* (content role) text/* (content role) —                         —           ≥4.5 / ≥3\nPrimary                   text + icon         action/primary-bg         action/primary-fg     action/primary-fg     —                         —           ≥4.5 / ≥3\nTone row                  functional-boundary surface/raised            —                     —                     border/strong             —           ≥3\nSecondary                 text + icon         action/secondary-bg       action/secondary-fg   action/secondary-fg   —                         —           ≥4.5 / ≥3\n… +55 more state / kind rows in this frame — full list in Foundation — Component-role contrast audit.\nDisabled specimens are listed in the failure / attention list below, never here.",
                  "lineHeight": "$line-height/normal",
                  "fontFamily": "$font/mono",
                  "fontSize": "$font-size/xs",
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "slHN4",
                  "name": "Audit summary",
                  "fill": "$semantic/text/secondary",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "ROW CLASS           LIGHT               DARK\ntext                9/9 PASS            9/9 PASS\nicon                7/7 PASS            7/7 PASS\nfunctional-boundary 2/2 PASS            2/2 PASS\ndecorative-boundary INFO 1              INFO 1\ndivider             INFO 0              INFO 0\nfocus-indicator     2/2 PASS            2/2 PASS\nFAIL rows           0                   0\nDISABLED / REVIEW   3                   3",
                  "lineHeight": "$line-height/normal",
                  "fontFamily": "$font/mono",
                  "fontSize": "$font-size/xs",
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "XlrTg",
                  "name": "Failure list",
                  "fill": "$semantic/text/secondary",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "SPECIMEN                  KIND                ACTUAL PAIR                                   LIGHT          DARK           EXPECTED PAIR\nresolved instance         node kind           surface → token                               ratio          ratio          contract pair\nDisabled                  disabled-icon       action/disabled-bg → action/disabled-fg       2.34 DISABLED  3.07 DISABLED  action/disabled-bg → disabled role\nDisabled                  disabled-text       action/disabled-bg → action/disabled-fg       2.34 DISABLED  3.07 DISABLED  action/disabled-bg → disabled role\nst-disabled               disabled-text       surface/base → text/tertiary                  7.24 DISABLED  7.87 DISABLED  surface/base → disabled role\n“text/*” in the expected pair means the surface's content-role text token.",
                  "lineHeight": "$line-height/normal",
                  "fontFamily": "$font/mono",
                  "fontSize": "$font-size/xs",
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "ZD0On",
                  "name": "Cause summary",
                  "fill": "$semantic/feedback/info-fg",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "No FAIL rows · DISABLED / REVIEW: 3 (ratios shown, never PASS)",
                  "lineHeight": "$line-height/normal",
                  "fontFamily": "$font/mono",
                  "fontSize": "$font-size/xs",
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "lByc1",
                  "name": "Audit legend",
                  "fill": "$semantic/text/tertiary",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "Node kinds decide the contract. Content: text (≥ 4.5:1) and icon (≥ 3:1) against their resolved surface, matching the surface role foreground (action/<kind>-fg, text/*, feedback/<kind>-fg, tooltip/fg). functional-boundary: identifies a control or state, ≥ 3:1 against border/strong or its role border. decorative-boundary: structural only, expected border/subtle, INFO. divider: separates regions, INFO. focus-indicator: the focus ring, ≥ 3:1.\nStatus: PASS — contrast and role pair hold. FAIL — contrast below threshold or the token is not the contract role pair. INFO — decorative boundary or divider; no WCAG verdict. DISABLED / REVIEW — the resolved specimen is explicitly disabled; the real ratio is shown and is never counted as PASS.\nToken paths are relative to semantic/ (action/secondary-fg = semantic/action/secondary-fg). Ratios are computed from the theme values resolved out of the variables. Every row comes from the same resolved-instance visitor; no row is filtered out. Disabled specimens are listed in the failure / attention list, never in the contract table.",
                  "lineHeight": "$line-height/normal",
                  "fontFamily": "$font/mono",
                  "fontSize": "$font-size/xs",
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                }
              ]
            },
