                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "Communicating outcome, progress and state without interrupting. Half of this category is passive: Badge, Spinner, Skeleton and Status Indicator have no hover, active or focus-visible state, and inventing one would be wrong.",
