                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "j93BL",
                  "name": "Scope",
                  "fill": "$semantic/text/secondary",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "Audit of the resolved role tokens used by this component's specimens. Every node is classified first by kind — text, icon, functional-boundary, decorative-boundary, divider, focus-indicator or the disabled-* variants — and only then compared with the expected contract pair, in light and dark. This is not the canonical rank audit: Foundation validates semantic/<group>/<step> tokens, this section validates component-role pairs (action, surface, text, border, focus, feedback, tooltip, overlay). Disabled visuals are marked DISABLED and never treated as PASS.",
                  "lineHeight": "$line-height/normal",
                  "fontFamily": "$font/body",
                  "fontSize": "$font-size/sm",
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "MJCK3",
                  "name": "Contract table",
                  "fill": "$semantic/text/secondary",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "STATE / VARIANT           KIND                SURFACE                   TEXT (expected)       ICON (expected)       BOUNDARY (expected)       FOCUS       EXPECTED RULE\nAlert variants            decorative-boundary surface/raised            —                     —                     border/subtle             —           INFO\nAlert variants            text + icon         surface/raised            text/* (content role) text/* (content role) —                         —           ≥4.5 / ≥3\nAlert variants            text + icon         feedback/neutral-bg       feedback/neutral-fg   feedback/neutral-fg   —                         —           ≥4.5 / ≥3\nAlert variants            text + icon         feedback/info-bg          feedback/info-fg      feedback/info-fg      —                         —           ≥4.5 / ≥3\nAlert variants            text + icon         feedback/positive-bg      feedback/positive-fg  feedback/positive-fg  —                         —           ≥4.5 / ≥3\n… +8 more state / kind rows in this frame — full list in Foundation — Component-role contrast audit.\nDisabled specimens are listed in the failure / attention list below, never here.",
                  "lineHeight": "$line-height/normal",
                  "fontFamily": "$font/mono",
                  "fontSize": "$font-size/xs",
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "n1L2tm",
                  "name": "Audit summary",
                  "fill": "$semantic/text/secondary",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "ROW CLASS           LIGHT               DARK\ntext                7/7 PASS            7/7 PASS\nicon                4/4 PASS            4/4 PASS\nfunctional-boundary 0/0 PASS            0/0 PASS\ndecorative-boundary INFO 6              INFO 6\ndivider             INFO 0              INFO 0\nfocus-indicator     0/0 PASS            0/0 PASS\nFAIL rows           0                   0\nDISABLED / REVIEW   0                   0",
                  "lineHeight": "$line-height/normal",
                  "fontFamily": "$font/mono",
                  "fontSize": "$font-size/xs",
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "DV41j",
                  "name": "Failure list",
                  "fill": "$semantic/text/secondary",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "SPECIMEN                  KIND                ACTUAL PAIR                                   LIGHT          DARK           EXPECTED PAIR\nresolved instance         node kind           surface → token                               ratio          ratio          contract pair\nNo FAIL or DISABLED rows — every resolved role pair meets its contract in both themes.\n“text/*” in the expected pair means the surface's content-role text token.",
                  "lineHeight": "$line-height/normal",
                  "fontFamily": "$font/mono",
                  "fontSize": "$font-size/xs",
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
